## Quick start

- Skills directory: `{{skillsDir}}`
- Commands directory: `{{commandsDir}}`
- Start a change: `/opsx-dev-pipeline` drives the full OpenSpec + Git pipeline (Phase 0-6)

## Pipeline Overview

| Phase | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| 0 | Entrance and preflight checks |
| 1 | Propose: create a change and generate artifacts |
| 2 | Apply: implement tasks with a self-review gate |
| 3 | Review: perform a multi-dimension code review |
| 4 | Unit Tests: identify and execute the test gate |
| 5 | Archive: verify, sync delta specs, and archive |
| 6 | Merge and Push: commit, push, and optionally merge and tag |

Run `/opsx-dev-pipeline` with a requirement description or an existing change name to begin.
